<title>USA: Corning expects segment spin-off by yr-end.</title>
<headline>Corning expects segment spin-off by yr-end.</headline>
<dateline>CORNING, N.Y. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corning Inc said on Tuesday its plans to spin off its health care services segment are on track.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to be completed by the end of the year, the company said as it released its earnings for the third quarter.</p>
<p>The company announced its plans to spin off the segment in mid-May. In this year's second quarter, the company began to account for the segment as a discontinued operation.</p>
